\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Why, my soul, do you worry,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Troubling over earthly issues?
\par They shall only pass away,
\par  Being as they are, dust and earth.
\par  Search for your saviour only;
\par  No other Saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Examine your mind with care,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Cast your eyes upward from the earth.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Turn then to the mighty Lord,
\par Ask Him for grace and compassion.
\par It is present in the Lord;
\par No other Saviour exist.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Your spirit is of the Lord,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  But your body, of the earth's dust.
\par  When your sin got you destroyed,
\par  Jesus came for your redemption;
\par  Therefore give yourself to Him;
\par  No other Saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4. Lo perfect rest your desire ?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  It is not found in things earthen.
\par  Perfect rest you may acquire,
\par  In the great love of your Saviour.
\par  Cleave you therefore unto Him;
\par    No other saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.   Observe your Saviour's glory,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And His achievements for your sake!
\par See it as a reality,
\par That you may reap its benefits.
\par Jesus redeemed you as well;
\par No other saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   Remember Him in all things,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And live by all His spoken words.
\par He has set a precedent,
\par And He's filled with vitality;
\par He will get you filled as well;
\par No other Saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7.   Follow your Saviour always,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Triffle not with daily prayer.
\par And, by every act of yours,
\par Make your gratitude manifest.
\par He's your single possession:
\par No other Saviour exist!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  8.  If you so cleave unto Him,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 He will take you to His heaven,
\par And you will have lasting peace
\par Where He is with God the father.
\par Search only for your saviour,
\par \pard    No other Saviour exist!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

